      ],
      "source": "https://www.trawellino.com/destinations/united-states/north-carolina_south-henderson"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "The community grew after Vance County was carved out of Granville, Warren, and Franklin Counties on May 5, 1881.",
